Navigation: web routes BOTH /battery and /battery/health to BatteryHealthPage (App.tsx).
A new AppRoute.batteryHealth (pathSegment "battery", energy group) is added; the parser's
two aliases that previously redirected to .energy now resolve to .batteryHealth, and the
route is registered + reachable + deep-linkable. The only exhaustive AppRoute switches
live in AppRoute.swift (systemImage + group, both updated) — verified no other file
switches over .batteryCells/.batteryDegradation, so none needed editing.

i18n: every visible literal resolves from Localizable.xcstrings using the WEB key names
verbatim; the i18next {{soh}}/{{pct}}/{{count}}/{{rate}}/{{n}} interpolations are
reproduced via String(localized:) + token substitution (BatteryHealthFormat.interpolate /
BatteryHealthDerivations.localized). A script confirmed all 105 required strings are
referenced in the Battery source AND present as xcstrings keys (0 missing each).

